  "details": "Like how Steam has curators you can follow to see the games they recommend, I think it would be great if VRChat allowed you to follow community curators to see the worlds they recommend. Open up a person's curator page and you'd get a window much like the current Worlds panel but featuring exclusively the worlds that person recommends. They could even categorize them by type. Experiences, Social Spaces, Homes, etcetera.\n\nCurators could even write brief reviews or descriptions of the worlds in their lists.\n\nMaybe we could upvote the curators whose recommendations we find useful?\n\n Honestly, I'd just wholesale steal the curator idea directly from Steam and apply it to VRChat.\n\nThis could be much more useful for finding content in VRChat than waiting for a random YouTube creator to post some world recommendations. The easier it is for users to find worlds that really appeal to them, the more engaged they become with VRChat in general.",
